        <div>
          <h3>프로젝트를 맡기고 싶습니다</h3>
          <p>AI 자동화 · 에이전트 파이프라인 · 결제 붙은 서비스를 기획부터 배포까지. 요구사항이 아직 문장이 아니어도 됩니다 — 캐내는 것부터가 제 일입니다.</p>
          <a class="btn btn-brass" href={mail('[프로젝트 의뢰] ')}>의뢰 문의하기 →</a>
        </div>
        <div>
          <h3>채용을 검토하고 있습니다</h3>
          <p>AI 인프라 · 에이전트 시스템 · 풀스택. 혼자 굴러가는 시스템을 짓는 사람이라, 팀에서도 남이 안 하는 자리를 맡습니다. 이력서와 상세 근거는 요청 주시면 보냅니다.</p>
          <a class="btn btn-cream" href={mail('[채용 문의] ')}>채용 문의하기 →</a>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="contact-foot">
        <span>박근민 · Justin Avery Park · 2026</span>
        <span><a href={`mailto:${EMAIL}`}>{EMAIL}</a> · <a href="https://github.com/rmsals1745" target="_blank" rel="noopener">GitHub</a> · <a href="#top">맨 위로 ↑</a></span>
      </div>
    </div>
  </footer>
</Base>

<style>
  /* ───────── 표지: 깊은 색면 하나 ───────── */
  .cover { position: relative; min-height: 100vh; background: var(--field); color: var(--cream); overflow: hidden;
    display: grid; grid-template-rows: auto 1fr auto auto; padding: 28px 56px 44px; }
  .cover-top { display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: baseline; gap: 24px; position: relative; z-index: 2;
    font-family: var(--mono); font-size: 14px; letter-spacing: .04em; text-transform: uppercase; }
  .cover-top b { font-family: var(--sans); font-size: 17px; letter-spacing: 0; text-transform: none; font-weight: 700; }
  .cover-top b .en { font-weight: 500; opacity: .75; }
  .cover-top nav { display: flex; gap: 28px; }
  .cover-top nav a { text-decoration: none; color: var(--cream); font-weight: 600; opacity: .8; }
  .cover-top nav a:hover { opacity: 1; color: var(--brass-soft); }
  .ring { position: absolute; right: 5vw; top: 50%; transform: translateY(-52%); width: min(38vw, 580px); height: auto; z-index: 0; }
  .statement { position: relative; z-index: 1; align-self: center; font-weight: 900; letter-spacing: -.04em; color: var(--cream);
    font-size: clamp(40px, 6.4vw, 100px); line-height: 1.04; margin: 40px 0 28px; max-width: 56vw; }
  .statement span { display: block; }
  .statement .indent { padding-left: 1em; }
  .statement em { font-style: normal; color: var(--brass-soft); }
  .rule { position: relative; z-index: 1; width: 88px; height: 6px; background: var(--brass); margin-bottom: 26px; }
  .cover-foot { position: relative; z-index: 2; display: flex; flex-direction: column; align-items: flex-start; gap: 22px; max-width: 46%; }
  .mobile-portrait-box { display: none; }
  .who-line { font-size: 18px; line-height: 1.6; max-width: 34em; color: #d8d2c3; }
  .who-line strong { font-weight: 700; color: var(--cream); }
  .cover-cta { display: flex; gap: 14px; flex-wrap: wrap; }
  .btn { display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: 10px; padding: 15px 24px; font-weight: 700; font-size: 16px; text-decoration: none; border-radius: 3px; transition: transform .15s, background .15s; }
  .btn:hover { transform: translateY(-2px); }
  .btn-brass { background: var(--brass); color: #1a2622; }
  .btn-brass:hover { background: var(--brass-soft); }
  .btn-ghost { color: var(--cream); text-decoration: underline; text-underline-offset: 5px; text-decoration-thickness: 2px; text-decoration-color: var(--brass); padding-left: 4px; padding-right: 4px; }
  .btn-cream { background: var(--cream); color: var(--ink); }
  .btn-cream:hover { background: #fff; }

  /* ───────── 프로필 사진 (side 및 모바일) ───────── */
  .profile-photo {
    width: 116px;
    height: 116px;
    object-fit: cover;
    object-position: center 15%;
    border-radius: 6px;
    background: #efe8da;
    padding: 4px;
    box-sizing: border-box;
    display: block;
  }
  .side-profile {
    margin-bottom: -10px;
  }

  /* ───────── 분할 본문 ───────── */
  .split { display: grid; grid-template-columns: minmax(300px, 380px) 1fr; gap: 72px; padding: 0 48px 0 0; }
  .side { position: sticky; top: 0; align-self: start; height: 100vh; padding: 48px 36px 36px 48px; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 24px;
    background: var(--field); color: var(--cream); overflow-y: auto; }
  .side h2 { font-size: 32px; line-height: 1.18; font-weight: 900; letter-spacing: -.03em; }
  .side h2 small { display: block; font-family: var(--mono); font-size: 13px; font-weight: 600; letter-spacing: .08em; color: var(--brass-soft); margin-bottom: 10px; text-transform: uppercase; }
  .side .lead { color: #cfc9ba; font-size: 15.5px; line-height: 1.65; }
  .label { font-size: 13px; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: .02em; color: var(--accent); margin-bottom: 8px; }
  .side .label { color: var(--brass-soft); }
  .hire { list-style: none; }
  .hire li { font-weight: 700; font-size: 15.5px; line-height: 1.5; padding: 3px 0; }
  .hire li span { font-weight: 400; color: #bfb9aa; font-size: 13.5px; display: block; }
  .side-contact a { display: block; font-weight: 700; text-decoration: none; font-size: 15.5px; }
  .side-contact a:hover { color: var(--brass-soft); }
  .toc { margin-top: auto; }
  .toc a { display: flex; gap: 14px; align-items: baseline; text-decoration: none; padding: 4px 0; font-size: 15px; color: #bfb9aa; transition: color .15s, padding .15s; }
  .toc a i { font-style: normal; font-family: var(--mono); font-size: 12px; width: 22px; }
  .toc a:hover, .toc a.on { color: var(--cream); padding-left: 8px; font-weight: 700; }
  .toc a.on i { color: var(--brass-soft); }

  .main { max-width: 940px; padding: 64px 0 40px; }
  .intro { font-size: 23px; line-height: 1.6; font-weight: 500; max-width: 30em; margin-bottom: 72px; }
  .intro mark { background: none; color: var(--accent); font-weight: 700; text-decoration: underline; text-decoration-color: var(--brass); text-decoration-thickness: 3px; text-underline-offset: 6px; }

  /* 타임라인 — 굵은 초록 선 */
  .timeline { position: relative; padding-left: 44px; }
  .timeline::before { content: ""; position: absolute; left: 9px; top: 12px; bottom: 12px; width: 4px; background: var(--field); }
  .case { position: relative; padding-bottom: 64px; scroll-margin-top: 32px; }
  .case::before { content: ""; position: absolute; left: -44px; top: 10px; width: 22px; height: 22px; background: var(--paper);
    outline: 4px solid var(--field); outline-offset: -4px; border-radius: 50%; }
  .case.open::before { background: var(--brass); }
  .when { font-size: 14px; font-weight: 700; color: var(--accent); }

  /* 케이스 헤더 & 썸네일 레이아웃 */
  .case-header {
    display: flex;
    justify-content: space-between;
    align-items: flex-start;
    gap: 28px;
    margin-bottom: 18px;
  }
  .case-meta { flex: 1 1 auto; }
  .case h3 { font-size: clamp(28px, 3vw, 40px); line-height: 1.12; font-weight: 900; letter-spacing: -.035em; margin: 6px 0 0; }
  .case h3 small { display: block; font-size: 17px; font-weight: 500; letter-spacing: -.01em; color: var(--ink-dim); margin-top: 10px; line-height: 1.5; }

  .case-thumb {
    flex: 0 0 200px;
    width: 200px;
    height: 125px;
    border-radius: 6px;
    overflow: hidden;
    background: #efe8da;
  }
  .thumb-media {
    width: 100%;
    height: 100%;
    object-fit: cover;
    display: block;
    border-radius: 6px;
    border: 0;
  }
  .thumb-svg {
    background: #efe8da;
  }

  .beats { display: grid; gap: 14px; max-width: 40em; }
  .beat { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 92px 1fr; gap: 16px; }
  .beat b { font-size: 14px; font-weight: 700; padding-top: 1px; color: var(--ink-dim); }
  .beat.result b { color: var(--accent); }
  .beat.result p { font-weight: 700; }
  .toggle { margin-top: 22px; background: var(--field); color: var(--cream); font: 700 15px var(--sans); padding: 12px 20px; cursor: pointer; border: 0; border-radius: 3px; display: inline-flex; gap: 10px; align-items: center; }
  .toggle:hover { background: var(--field-3); }
  .toggle .ar { display: inline-block; transition: transform .2s; color: var(--brass-soft); }
  .case.open .toggle .ar { transform: rotate(45deg); }
  .detail { display: grid; grid-template-rows: 0fr; transition: grid-template-rows .35s ease; }
  .detail > div { overflow: hidden; }
  .case.open .detail { grid-template-rows: 1fr; }
  .detail-in { margin-top: 26px; padding: 30px 32px; background: var(--field); color: var(--cream); border-radius: 4px; max-width: 44em; }
  .detail-media { margin-bottom: 22px; border-radius: 4px; overflow: hidden; }
  .detail-media img { width: 100%; height: auto; display: block; border-radius: 4px; }
  .detail-in h4 { font-size: 15px; letter-spacing: .02em; color: var(--brass-soft); margin: 22px 0 8px; font-weight: 700; }
  .detail-in h4:first-child { margin-top: 0; }
  .detail-in p, .detail-in li { font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.7; }
  .detail-in ul { padding-left: 1.1em; }
  .detail-in li { margin: 6px 0; }
  .detail-in strong { color: var(--brass-soft); }
  .detail-in .stack { margin-top: 18px; font-family: var(--mono); font-size: 13px; color: #a9b8b1; }
  .detail-in .more { margin-top: 14px; }
  .detail-in .more a { color: var(--cream); font-weight: 700; text-decoration: underline; text-decoration-color: var(--brass); text-underline-offset: 5px; }
  .detail-in .more a:hover { color: var(--brass-soft); }

  /* 나머지 목록 */
  .rest { margin-top: 24px; padding: 0; scroll-margin-top: 32px; }
  .rest h3 { font-size: 30px; font-weight: 900; letter-spacing: -.03em; margin-bottom: 8px; }
  .rest > p { color: var(--ink-dim); margin-bottom: 22px; }
  .rest ol { list-style: none; counter-reset: r; }
  .rest li { counter-increment: r; display: grid; grid-template-columns: 44px 210px 1fr 96px; gap: 18px; padding: 18px 0; align-items: baseline; border-top: 2px solid var(--ink); }
  .rest li::before { content: counter(r, decimal-leading-zero); font-family: var(--mono); font-size: 13px; color: var(--accent); font-weight: 600; }
  .rest li b { font-size: 18px; font-weight: 900; letter-spacing: -.02em; line-height: 1.35; }
  .rest li b a { text-decoration: none; }
  .rest li b a:hover { color: var(--accent); text-decoration: underline; text-decoration-color: var(--brass); text-underline-offset: 5px; }
  .rest li p { font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; color: var(--ink-dim); }
  .rest li time { font-family: var(--mono); font-size: 12px; color: var(--ink-dim); text-align: right; }

  /* 연락 — 표지 색면으로 돌아온다 */
  .contact { background: var(--field); color: var(--cream); padding: 110px 56px 60px; margin-top: 80px; position: relative; overflow: hidden; }
  .contact-in { max-width: 1360px; margin: 0 auto; position: relative; z-index: 1; }
  .contact h2 { font-size: clamp(38px, 5.4vw, 80px); line-height: 1.06; font-weight: 900; letter-spacing: -.045em; max-width: 9em; }
  .tracks { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; gap: 56px; margin-top: 64px; max-width: 1100px; }
  .tracks h3 { font-size: 24px; font-weight: 900; letter-spacing: -.02em; margin-bottom: 10px; }
  .tracks p { font-size: 16px; margin-bottom: 20px; max-width: 30em; color: #d8d2c3; }
  .contact-foot { margin-top: 80px; display: flex; justify-content: space-between; gap: 20px; flex-wrap: wrap; font-family: var(--mono); font-size: 13px; font-weight: 600; color: #bfb9aa; }
  .contact-foot a { text-decoration: underline; text-underline-offset: 4px; text-decoration-color: var(--brass); }
  .contact svg { position: absolute; right: -180px; bottom: -220px; width: 560px; z-index: 0; }

  /* ───────── 모바일: 분할 → 한 줄 ───────── */
  @media (max-width: 900px) {
    .cover { padding: 20px 18px 28px; min-height: 100svh; grid-template-rows: auto auto auto auto auto; align-content: start; }
    .cover-top nav { display: none; }
    .cover-top { font-size: 12px; }
